 Those are (mostly) ways to get away from an (M)MF. It also pays not to get
near them in the first place:

 Keep an eye on the population of the level with telepathy, skilled detect
monster, etc. Watch out for waves of psychic energy. Whenever you spot an
(M)MF anywhere on the level, disposing of it before it can sneak up on you
should be high priority. Play _very_ carefully (i.e. step by step, watching
messages) when fighting summoners. As soon as you get an (M)MF in a
summoned nasty crowd, either teleport away, teleport the 'h' away, or at
the very least burn Elbereth.

 I play all of my games genoless since my YAFAP, and it really makes the
game more interesting. As long as you are appropriately scared of the
purple h, your chances of not being brainsucked are rather good.

